{
  "name": "nopCommerce: new order → Google Sheets row",
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false,
    "description": "Adds a row to a Google Sheet for each new nopCommerce order, with customer, items and totals."
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "0c702d58-c8d6-461d-a98d-c50c8bf36e6a",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## New order → Google Sheets\n\n1. Make a sheet whose first row has these headers: Order, Order ID, Date, Customer, Email, Country, Status, Payment, Items, Subtotal, Shipping, Tax, Total, Currency, Admin link.\n2. **New order:** choose your Cartenvo Integration Hub credential (scope `webhooks:manage`).\n3. **Add row:** choose your Google credential, the spreadsheet and the sheet.\n4. Activate.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5611119a-8b19-4ed0-abad-cad62799eed2",
      "name": "New order",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-cartenvo.cartenvoTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "events": [
          "order.placed"
        ],
        "format": "full",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "0d8dd9a0-c6a5-490b-a86e-f97eaa9a7fbe"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a6dad89-acbd-4188-abfe-d76e5a10c8d8",
      "name": "Add row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        260,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gid=0",
          "cachedResultName": "Sheet1"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "Order": "={{ $json.data.number }}",
            "Order ID": "={{ $json.data.id }}",
            "Date": "={{ $json.data.createdOnUtc }}",
            "Customer": "={{ $json.data.customer.firstName }} {{ $json.data.customer.lastName }}",
            "Email": "={{ $json.data.customer.email }}",
            "Country": "={{ $json.data.shippingAddress?.countryCode || $json.data.billingAddress?.countryCode || \"\" }}",
            "Status": "={{ $json.data.status }}",
            "Payment": "={{ $json.data.paymentStatus }}",
            "Items": "={{ $json.data.items.map(i => i.quantity + ' x ' + (i.sku || i.name)).join(', ') }}",
            "Subtotal": "={{ $json.data.totals.subtotalExclTax }}",
            "Shipping": "={{ $json.data.totals.shippingExclTax }}",
            "Tax": "={{ $json.data.totals.tax }}",
            "Total": "={{ $json.data.totals.total }}",
            "Currency": "={{ $json.data.currency }}",
            "Admin link": "={{ $json.data.adminUrl }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
